mac80211_hwsim: allow the kernel-medium identity bound for static radios

The EasyMesh stress profile needs five mesh radios plus one hundred client
radios.  Raise the module-load bound from 100 to the already fixed and checked
kernel-medium identity capacity of 128.  This remains a lab-only static pool;
the default radio count is unchanged.

--- a/drivers/net/wireless/virtual/mac80211_hwsim.c
+++ b/drivers/net/wireless/virtual/mac80211_hwsim.c
@@ -7708,7 +7708,7 @@
 {
 	int i, err;
 
-	if (radios < 0 || radios > 100)
+	if (radios < 0 || radios > HWSIM_KERNEL_MEDIUM_MAX_RADIOS)
 		return -EINVAL;
 
